     "zh-CN": "Supabase 官方托管远程 MCP 服务，默认以只读模式（read_only=true）连接：可查看项目与数据表、以只读数据库用户执行查询、查看日志与安全建议、查看边缘函数。由 Teloa 以 OAuth（动态客户端注册 + PKCE）授权，令牌自动刷新，不需要填写访问令牌。",
     "en": "Supabase's official hosted remote MCP service, connected in read-only mode (read_only=true) by default: browse projects and tables, run queries as a read-only database user, read logs and advisors, and view Edge Functions. Authorized by Teloa via OAuth (dynamic client registration + PKCE) with automatic token refresh; no access token needs to be entered."
    },
