    ]
   },
   "compatibility": {
    "status": "needs-configuration",
    "teloa": ">=0.2.0-alpha.6",
    "dsh": "0.1.7-rc.1",
    "conditions": [
     {
      "zh-CN": "需在 市场 > 连接 页由本人在浏览器中用 Composio 账户完成 OAuth 授权；服务器部署需在配置文件设置 oauth.publicCallbackUrl",
      "en": "The owner must complete OAuth authorization with a Composio account in a browser from Market > Connections; server deployments must set oauth.publicCallbackUrl in the config file"
     },
     {
      "zh-CN": "Composio 是聚合平台：你在 Composio 连接的各个应用，其账号令牌由 Composio 保管，每次调用都经 Composio 服务器转发到对应应用。COMPOSIO_MULTI_EXECUTE_TOOL 可以修改已连接应用里的数据，Teloa 对它的每次调用逐次确认。",
      "en": "Composio is an aggregation platform: it holds the account tokens of every app you connect there, and each call is relayed through Composio's servers to that app. COMPOSIO_MULTI_EXECUTE_TOOL can change data in connected apps, and Teloa asks for confirmation on every call."
     },
     {
      "zh-CN": "服务地址为 connect.composio.dev/mcp（旧地址 mcp.composio.dev/mcp 已停用）。授权服务器公开的配置信息支持动态客户端注册（token_endpoint_auth_method none）与 PKCE S256，令牌与注册由 login.composio.dev 处理；2026-09-27 实测客户端注册成功、授权页正常跳转到 Composio 登录页。",
      "en": "The service address is connect.composio.dev/mcp (the old address mcp.composio.dev/mcp is retired). The authorization server's published configuration supports dynamic client registration (token_endpoint_auth_method none) and PKCE S256, with tokens and registration handled by login.composio.dev; on 2026-09-27 client registration succeeded and the authorization page redirected to the Composio sign-in page."
     },
     {
      "zh-CN": "同一套 OAuth 流程已在 Cloudflare 连接器上用真实账户走通（注册、授权、令牌交换、工具调用）。",
      "en": "The same OAuth flow has been run end to end with a real account on the Cloudflare connector (registration, consent, token exchange, tool calls)."
     },
     {
      "zh-CN": "登录 Composio 之后的令牌交换与工具调用未经 Teloa 真实账户实测，工具清单按官方文档列出；使用中遇到问题请在资源详情页点「问题反馈」。",
      "en": "Token exchange and tool calls after signing in to Composio have not been tested with a real account by Teloa, and the tool list follows the official documentation; if something does not work, use Report a problem on the resource page."
     }
    ]
